&_nc_oc=AdoS7Sv1wNAvwTqy9lUAH2aHZoosUDU4zM73hAbzWaaQxwatyXbr9_5UEwrXgaYz7ow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCfrpKN0iHQUbSJwTi9v50QNp6xS-mkkGEeeJlRS6MVaQ&oe=6A65EC7E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0_Wu-9Zwyv4Q7kNvwHVX3lm&_nc_oc=AdrocrlZVyuYIenGpzSKVeTTVjKZ4JiEc4pqEbnT2NpEnMZhlJ9Vqo4Pj8KuIdr7qcQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDJ6VryyVTyr0vKBXO5WmEtyTewv7rS8cglbFli25ntog&oe=6A65FD7C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uJhjm9nDyo4Q7kNvwHWlzfm&_nc_oc=AdrqmbAflCO9oyEyz9Ky77f65JkRc2BDxWJvFZfdsXaN8-f8rnlRJwchtHyvXdc7oJI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDs2UOJn5B6yks5hr-esLK1EnpU17n8b-ffBTbj7Mi9ag&oe=6A661C07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KJEAXVcQswwQ7kNvwG5-yvK&_nc_oc=AdqXq860-Cm51J2pvR4CCi6LkEvYxgnAZDc7vmB0XkcTuyCbPCLqWi8otD0oFYcu3j8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAzs4_v4OuMSZqxE27dJ8xNx7bcUk_2UEySELjhjWlKMA&oe=6A6607D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yRoOn9moeFYQ7kNvwFGxrNd&_nc_oc=AdqD-w69c0wNqrn45dIk90Lbi2aymcMrN-uVJGQbfF1Rvjixc4PrEXLlEiuZqVK_zZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC6_vBI8i6SbsHlYVdEtLY7ttcCBc7YtcGYGoKb2pFogw&oe=6A661464"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.